If a patient has a depression then every clinician should optimize a depression-treatment for the patient and should optimize a pain-treatment for the patient.
If a patient has a mental-health-condition then every clinician should optimize a mental-health-condition-treatment for the patient and should optimize a pain-treatment for the patient.
If a behavioral-health-specialist-consultation is needed for a patient then every clinician should consult a behavioral-health-specialist for the patient.
